Package: zutempo
Title: Dates, Times and Durations Following the 'TC39' Temporal
    Specification
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: An implementation of the Temporal date and time model of
    'ECMA-262' in 'R', with a native 'C' core: 'Instant', 'ZonedDateTime',
    'PlainDateTime', 'PlainDate', 'PlainTime', 'PlainYearMonth',
    'PlainMonthDay', 'Duration' and 'Now', in the ISO 8601 calendar, with
    'IANA' time zones read from the same database that base 'R' uses.
    Values are stored exactly in 'R' vectors, arithmetic is done over the
    specification's full ranges with exact 128-bit intermediates, and
    strings follow RFC 9557 with annotations. Every result is meant to
    match the result of the same operation in a browser or in 'Node'.
